<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - M. Stanley ups bank price targets.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - M. Stanley ups bank price targets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it raised the price target on Citicorp to $166 from $157.</p>
<p>-- said also raised the price target on Chase Manhattan Corp to $125 from $119 and raised BankAmerica Corp to $81 from $79.</p>
<p>-- the specific length of time for the price target was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Citicorp gained 4-9/16, Chase added two to 111-9/16 and BankAmerica inreased 1-1/16 to 72-15/16.</p>
</text>
